Subject: Allow restricted Git Bash to open its own local IPC objects

Adapted from git-for-windows/msys2-runtime d25c02bd8bbfef7da4b42eab6f0834bcb9d9343e,
winsup/cygwin autoload.cc, fhandler/pipe.cc, fork.cc, local_includes/security.h,
mm/shared.cc, pinfo.cc, sec/helper.cc and sigproc.cc. Cygwin license applies.

